## Language Comparison

### C++ vs Other Popular Languages

#### C++ vs Python
```cpp
// C++ - Fast, Compiled, Type-safe
#include <iostream>
#include <vector>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    vector<int> nums = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
    for (int n : nums) {
        cout << n * 2 << " ";
    }
    return 0;
}
// Output: 2 4 6 8 10
// Performance: ~1ms, compiled to machine code
```

```python
# Python - Simple, Interpreted, Dynamic
nums = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
for n in nums:
    print(n * 2, end=' ')
# Output: 2 4 6 8 10
# Performance: ~100ms, interpreted at runtime
```

**Comparison**:
| Aspect | C++ | Python |
|--------|-----|--------|
| Speed | 100x faster | 1x (baseline) |
| Compilation | Compiled | Interpreted |
| Type Safety | Static, checked at compile | Dynamic, checked at runtime |
| Memory | Manual control | Automatic (garbage collection) |
| Learning Curve | Steep | Gentle |
| Deployment | Executable binary | Requires Python runtime |
| Use Cases | Systems, games, HFT | Data science, scripting, ML |

#### C++ vs Java
```cpp
