```

**Comparison**:
| Aspect | C++ | Java |
|--------|-----|------|
| Memory Model | Manual, stack/heap | Automatic, heap with GC |
| Garbage Collection | Manual/Smart Pointers | Automatic |
| Performance | Native speed | 5-50% slower (JVM overhead) |
| Platform | OS-specific compilation | Write once, run anywhere (JVM) |
| Concurrency | Manual threads | Built-in threading model |
