### Containers - Detailed Comparison

**Vector vs Deque vs List**: Performance Trade-offs

```cpp
#include <vector>
#include <deque>
#include <list>

// Performance Comparison (n = 1 million elements)
//               Vector  Deque   List
// Access[i]      O(1)    O(1)    O(n)     - Random access
// Insert front   O(n)    O(1)    O(1)     - Add at beginning
// Insert back    O(1)    O(1)    O(1)     - Add at end
// Insert middle  O(n)    O(n)    O(1)     - Add in middle
// Delete front   O(n)    O(1)    O(1)     - Remove from beginning
// Delete back    O(1)    O(1)    O(1)     - Remove from end
// Delete middle  O(n)    O(n)    O(1)     - Remove from middle
// Memory         Compact Fragmented Fragmented

