#### Q2: Explain the difference between stack and heap allocation

**Answer**:
```cpp
// Stack allocation (automatic)
{
    int x = 42;                 // Stack allocation
    vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3}; // Vector on stack, data on heap
    // Auto cleanup when scope ends
}

