#### Q5: What are the differences between vector, deque, and list?

**Answer**:
```cpp
// Performance comparison (n = 1,000,000)
//            Vector  Deque   List
// Access     O(1)    O(1)    O(n)
// Insert[0]  O(n)    O(1)    O(1)
// Insert[n]  O(1)    O(1)    O(1)
// Delete[0]  O(n)    O(1)    O(1)
// Memory     Compact Fragmented Fragmented

// Use vector when:
vector<int> v1;
for (int i = 0; i < 1000000; i++) {
    v1.push_back(i);  // Fast random access, sequential append
}
