## Common Gotchas

### Most Vexing Parse
```cpp
// Ambiguous declaration
Time t();  // Is this a variable or function declaration?
           // Compiler interprets as function declaration

// Solution
Time t{};  // Clearly a variable with default initialization
```

### Operator Overload Gotcha
```cpp
class Vector {
public:
    Vector operator+(const Vector& v);
    Vector& operator+=(const Vector& v);
};

// Issue: Inconsistent implementations can cause confusion
v1 = v2 + v3;    // Uses operator+
v1 += v2;        // Uses operator+=
```

### String Comparison
```cpp
string s1 = "hello";
string s2 = "hello";
cout << (s1 == s2);  // true - compares value

const char* c1 = "hello";
const char* c2 = "hello";
cout << (c1 == c2);  // May be false - compares pointer address
```

### Vector Iterator Invalidation
```cpp
vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3};
auto it = v.begin();

v.push_back(4);        // May reallocate - iterator invalidated!
